hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"398","Hamein Abu Tawbah ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Ishaq — yani al-Fazari — ne khabar di, Abu Ishaq — yani al-Shaybani — se, unhon ne al-Qasim — yani Ibn Abd al-Rahman — se riwayat kiya: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Logon ko un ki qasmon mein us cheez par majboor na karo jise woh nahin jante."
